  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>m</mi></math> and <math><mi>M</mi></math> denotes the minimum and maximum value of <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
